[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3973294342","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116845#issuecomment-3973294342","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116845","id":3973294342,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7s06kG","user":{"login":"migueldeicaza","id":36863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza","html_url":"https://github.com/migueldeicaza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T14:37:57Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T14:37:57Z","body":"It does seem that Node::can_process() has some room for optimization:\n\nThe checks that it performs are whether it is in tree (the chunky caller in SceneTree::process_group will do that check anyways), whether it is suspended and the process_mode logic.   It seems to me that a slightly better way of doing this was to continuously update a Node::can_process boolean whenever any of those three state variables change, so that the check becomes a field load, rather than this costly evaluation performed on a quasi empty project on over 400 elements per frame.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3973294342/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3973954492","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116845#issuecomment-3973954492","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116845","id":3973954492,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7s3bu8","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T16:46:35Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T16:46:35Z","body":"I had my eyes on the network polling in the language server for a while now. But it never was significant on my high end PC, so I did not seem worth the effort to look into. Do you have raw numbers on that specific part?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3973954492/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974016363","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116845#issuecomment-3974016363","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116845","id":3974016363,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7s3q1r","user":{"login":"migueldeicaza","id":36863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza","html_url":"https://github.com/migueldeicaza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T16:59:54Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T16:59:54Z","body":"I do, yes:\n\n- DebuggerServer consumes 6.1% of the frame processing time\n- GDScriptLanguageServerProtocol 2.0% of the frame processing time\n\n<img width=\"2274\" height=\"312\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/971092d1-d7fd-4dab-a049-5c897064deb1\" />\n\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3974016363/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3975076266","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116845#issuecomment-3975076266","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116845","id":3975076266,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7s7tmq","user":{"login":"migueldeicaza","id":36863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza","html_url":"https://github.com/migueldeicaza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T21:02:29Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T21:00:13Z","body":"I have now reduced my idle CPU consumption from 68ms to 36ms for a 1second range, but the best part is this: no hitches\n\nBefore:\n\n<img width=\"644\" height=\"172\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2eb95498-da80-4a97-8233-9d05001ee465\" />\n\nAfter:\n\n<img width=\"955\" height=\"374\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/702a3e1c-a147-4630-8bfc-0e318c46026c\" />\n\nThe changes:\n1. Small fix for LineEdit to prevent needless polling\n2. Avoid socket polling on Debugger adapter and GDScriptLSP servers, by using Apple's DispatchQueues to be notified of connections and disconnections - happy to share the patch, but it is narrow for my use case, someone would need to do the equivalent for Linux and Windows.\n3. SceneTreeDock does not call the hyper expensive EDITOR_GET on each frame, instead, I subscribe to the ProjectSettings changes and monitor the state in a variable.\n4. EditorExport: I do not use it, so I turned off the aggressive refresh for export-presets, someone could investigate whether this is really necessary.\n5. Disabled the polling for EditorExport::get_singleton()->poll_export_platforms() in editor_run_native, again because I am not using it, but a better solution would be to have it rely on a signal and the export people could post when something changes instead.\n\nI will submit PRs for (2) and (3), (2) might not be everyone's cup of tea.  I think (3) is a no-brainer.\n\n[1] LineEdit: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116853\n[2] Poll avoidance: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116866\n[3] SceneTreeDock Polling: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116864\n\nAfter I wrote the above, another candidate came up:\n\n[6] Hoist another batch of expensive EDITOR_GET from the 3D editor: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116872\n[7] Avoid process_internal in various components when a perfect alternative exists: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117024\n[8] Prevent audio stack from churning when there is nothing to do while idling, and makes it so Godot does not prevent MacOS from sleeping: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117162","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3975076266/reactions","total_count":12,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":5,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3976131635","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116845#issuecomment-3976131635","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116845","id":3976131635,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7s_vQz","user":{"login":"migueldeicaza","id":36863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza","html_url":"https://github.com/migueldeicaza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-28T02:17:59Z","updated_at":"2026-02-28T02:17:59Z","body":"Update: from the chat, someone was profiling this on their system and they were also struggling with these, he found another good candidate, and I am sharing the PR:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116872","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3976131635/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3977239217","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116845#issuecomment-3977239217","issue_url":"https://api.git